<view class="page"><view class="safe-top"/><view class="topbar"><view><view class="brand">风里有约</view><view class="brand-sub">GO TOGETHER</view></view></view><view class="page-title">同行邀约</view><view class="page-copy">先了解这一次的时间、地点与节奏；有疑问可以先问，再决定是否加入。</view><view class="chip-row"><button class="chip {{tab==='open'?'active':''}}" data-tab="open" bindtap="tab">正在邀约</button><button class="chip {{tab==='mine'?'active':''}}" data-tab="mine" bindtap="tab">我的邀约</button></view><view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="loading">正在查看邀约…</view><block wx:else><block wx:if="{{items.length}}"><block wx:for="{{items}}" wx:key="_id"><view class="invite-card"><view class="invite-top"><text class="status-pill">{{item.status==='open'?'正在邀约':'已结束'}}</text><button class="text-link" data-user-id="{{item.host_user_id}}" bindtap="hostProfile">发起人主页</button></view><view class="invite-title">{{item.route.title}}</view><view class="invite-copy">📍 {{item.meet_place}}<br/>◷ {{item.start_time}}　·　{{item.companion_meta}}<br/>{{item.member_count}} / {{item.max_people}} 人</view><view class="invite-note">“{{item.note}}”</view><view class="invite-actions"><button class="secondary-btn" data-id="{{item.route._id}}" bindtap="detail">看路线</button><button wx:if="{{!item.joined&&item.role!=='host'}}" class="secondary-btn" data-id="{{item._id}}" bindtap="openQuestion">问问发起人</button><button wx:if="{{item.role==='host'}}" class="primary-btn" data-id="{{item._id}}" bindtap="closeInvitation">结束邀约</button><button wx:elif="{{item.joined}}" class="primary-btn" data-id="{{item._id}}" bindtap="chat">进入本次群聊</button><button wx:else class="primary-btn" data-id="{{item._id}}" bindtap="join">加入这次同行</button></view><button wx:if="{{item.joined&&item.role!=='host'}}" class="leave-btn" data-id="{{item._id}}" bindtap="leaveInvitation">退出本次同行</button></view></block></block><view wx:else class="empty">暂时没有合适的同行邀约。<br/>从一条路线开始，也可以自己发起一次出发。</view></block><block wx:if="{{showQuestion}}"><view class="modal-mask" bindtap="closeQuestion"/><view class="bottom-sheet"><view class="sheet-handle"/><view class="sheet-title">问问发起人</view><view class="sheet-copy">只围绕这一次出发沟通；加入后才会进入本次临时群聊。</view><view class="paper-card question-context"><b>{{questionInvitation.route.title}}</b><text>{{questionInvitation.start_time}} · {{questionInvitation.meet_place}}</text></view><textarea class="field-textarea" placeholder="例如：需要提前预约吗？我可能晚 10 分钟到，可以吗？" value="{{questionBody}}" bindinput="questionInput"/><button class="primary-btn sheet-btn" loading="{{asking}}" bindtap="submitQuestion">发送问题</button></view></block></view>